    "sections": {
        "description": "Carpenter Handy Service WordPress Theme. Carpenter Master is a sleek, modern, and highly functional WordPress Block FSE theme tailored for carpenters, craftsmen, and woodworking professionals. Designed to showcase carpentry projects, furniture repair services, and construction expertise, this theme features pre-built page templates and ready-to-use design patterns, making it easy to create a professional online presence. With a clean and responsive layout, Carpenter Master ensures a seamless user experience across all devices. Optimized for lightning-fast performance and built with SEO-friendly coding, it enhances search visibility and website efficiency. Whether you're an independent handyman or a large-scale woodworking business, Carpenter Master provides the perfect foundation to highlight your skills, attract clients, and grow your brand effortlessly."
    },
